   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜のに: even though, despite",
     "texto": [
      "Put the sentence in the plain form and add **のに**: **やくそく した のに、 ともだち は きませんでした** (even though we had arranged to meet, my friend didn't come).",
      "What comes after **のに** is what doesn't happen as expected or is surprising."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "〜のに with ない and with nouns",
     "texto": [
      "With the **ない** form it works the same way: **おかね が ない のに、 ふく を かいました** (even though I had no money, I bought clothes). With -i adjectives, use the plain form: **たかい のに、 かいました**.",
      "With nouns and -na adjectives, add **な**: **やすみ なのに、 しごと が あります** (even though it's a day off, there's work)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
